  * Ìwé Orin Mímọ́ and other translations, which belong to their respective
    church publishers.
  * Bible translations quoted in the responsive readings (NIV, NKJV, NASB,
    RSV, NEB, TEV, the Jerusalem Bible, the New Jewish Version), which belong
    to their publishers.
  * The hymn recordings, which belong to their performers and publishers.

Those materials are included as a worship aid for people who own the printed
